{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755980/extras/8eb9a076d5acef51def00ec87f7798f4.webp?t=1759428788\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deployment is a dynamic competitive top-down shooter where infosoldiers (units of pure data) battle for control over the digital systems that run the world. Deploy troops from five unique classes, fight on randomly generated maps, capture system turrets, and defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755980/extras/1111971798e762d3cc9aad1edf488d1a.poster.avif?t=1759428788\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755980/extras/1111971798e762d3cc9aad1edf488d1a.webm?t=1759428788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755980/extras/1111971798e762d3cc9aad1edf488d1a.mp4?t=1759428788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story / Setting</strong><br>After the Last War, civilization is on the brink of collapse \u2014 but computers still manage the key systems (energy, transport, factories). Whoever controls these systems controls the world. In this digital war, governments and megacorporations send infosoldiers into battle to seize the Etherweb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755980/extras/85d2063e52bab89e342b9521052288e2.poster.avif?t=1759428788\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755980/extras/85d2063e52bab89e342b9521052288e2.webm?t=1759428788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755980/extras/85d2063e52bab89e342b9521052288e2.mp4?t=1759428788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of five classes: Gunner, Pyro, Sniper, Cyclops, Rocketeer \u2014 each with unique skills and playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense 5v5 or free-for-all battles on randomly generated arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture and defend system turrets to gain tactical advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience, upgrade your class, and unlock new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in multiplayer or train solo against AI bots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the leaderboards, cooperate with your squad, and develop your own playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755980/extras/f6c319e6bc3031e561b0eccac3e3b0d6.avif?t=1759428788\" width=600 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong><br>\u2022 Fast-paced competitive top-down shooter<br>\u2022 Randomly generated maps \u2014 every battle is unique<br>\u2022 Five distinct classes with different weapons and playstyles<br>\u2022 System turret capture as a key tactical mechanic<br>\u2022 Single-player mode with bots for practice<br>\u2022 Leaderboards, progression, and class customization<br>\u2022 Sci-fi style and abstract design focused on gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755980/extras/8eb9a076d5acef51def00ec87f7798f4.webp?t=1759428788\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_par